speaker_encoder.onnx is the WeSpeaker ResNet34-LM speaker embedding model
(https://huggingface.co/Wespeaker/wespeaker-voxceleb-resnet34-LM), trained on VoxCeleb2 by the
WeSpeaker project (https://github.com/wenet-e2e/wespeaker). Earshield stores its weights as float16
(tools/half_storage.py); it runs unchanged in float32.

